WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.509 line:88%
Example — OpenRouter: sign in on the service's site.

2
00:00:03.559 --> 00:00:06.362 line:88%
Keys → Create API key → a name → Create.

3
00:00:06.412 --> 00:00:10.274 line:88%
Copy the sk-or-v1-… key — the site shows it only once.

4
00:00:10.324 --> 00:00:13.597 line:88%
In MemuAI Proxy: «Accounts» → «Add account».

5
00:00:13.647 --> 00:00:18.803 line:88%
Ready-made connections: pick the service — the API address is already filled in.

6
00:00:18.853 --> 00:00:23.244 line:88%
Paste the key. The prefix is how the models are named in the Proxy.

7
00:00:23.294 --> 00:00:28.626 line:88%
«Add» — then «Check» on the account card: the Proxy loads the model list.

8
00:00:28.676 --> 00:00:38.070 line:88%
Every service form has «Where to get a key» and «Docs» links.
